WEBVTT

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:05.050
But a touch-up.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:41.830
On the last episode of Dragon Ball Z, Piccolo and Nail fused into one being.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:49.680
And while Goku was still trying to heal, the battle between Frieza and the warriors from the planet Earth began.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:59.970
Luckily, Vegeta became their ally once again and was taking most of the heat from the...

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:11.180
super power with Vegeta's increased strength it seemed like an even match

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:17.820
between the two Giants of combat but Vegeta knew that Frieza was holding

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.380
back and he began to talk Frieza into transforming and revealing his true

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:29.980
power but look out perhaps pushing for the transformation wasn't the one

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.810
decision after all. What danger awaits Krillin, Gohan, and Vegeta now?

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:56.810
I think you're fooling. You grew two inches and got rid of your armor. You call that a transformation?

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:14.380
Vegeta, it pains me to see you going through this. What a waste. I favored you so much. Why couldn't you just continue to obey me?

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:23.720
Obey? I just pretended to obey you, you fool. I've been waiting patiently for any chance I could get to destroy you once and for all.

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:29.310
Yes, you're just like your father, aren't you? The good king.

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:35.390
You probably don't remember your father very well, do you, Vegeta?

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:39.260
What? The planet Tasba hasn't been occupied yet?

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:43.920
No, sire. The resistance there is much stronger than we ever expected.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.420
We're now estimating three more days.

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:47.910
Three days?

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:49.300
Yes, sire.

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:54.540
Have you forgotten that we promised to deliver that planet to Lord Frieza by tomorrow?

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:57.080
No, of course not, sire, I know!

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:59.970
But the full moon there is three days away.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.340
Get lost, sire!

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:07.840
Strong! You heard me!

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:25.300
You're such a brute, Vegeta.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:28.790
Those two days didn't matter to me.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:29.960
Oh wa-

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:35.420
Poor dope. You don't mind if I sit down, do you?

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:43.700
Ah, it's warm. You're too kind. Are we still in agreement about your son?

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:47.520
Yes, we are. You can have him.

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:56.770
Blended. You can bring him when you come to inform me about the progress on Tazba.

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:05.070
Hmm. You should try to be a little more lenient on your subjects.

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:18.200
Sire, we can't hand over the prince to him. I'd rather die than do that.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:21.040
Me too. But for now, we'll do as he says.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:22.420
Please, sire.

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:27.600
I don't have a choice, Zorn. We have to strike when the time is right.

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:29.980
If we act too hastily, the...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:35.460
be nothing left worth defending yes Martin don't worry we'll have our day oh

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:47.800
yes he had his day all right just like you're having yours now do you remember

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:53.430
what are you saying you were there safely tucked away in the bowels of my ship

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:56.570
while your dad was making his ill-fated plan remember

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.280
Now, the prince is on board Frieza's ship, so we want to try and keep it intact.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:08.270
You are the greatest fighters on our planet.

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:09.530
You are the elite.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:13.290
Together you will fight, and together you will conquer.

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:31.520
Lord Freeza!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:37.180
King Vegeta has arrived, escorted by a squadron of his men, and he's requested an audience with you.

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:42.660
Lord Freeza?

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:46.700
Sarban, the last time I had my hearing checked, it was just fine.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:47.580
Right.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:49.910
Open the doors!

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:55.010
As you wish, sire.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:02.590
Some of you.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:42.860
Why those nasty monkeys, Zarbun.

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:44.930
Go ahead and open my door.

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:48.780
Vegeta wanted an audience with me, and that's what he's going to get.

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:49.890
Right.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:54.880
This is no way for guests on my ship to behave.

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:58.790
Freeza! We have some business!

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:07.390
It's over, Frieza! We've come to put an end to your reign of terror!

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:10.320
We? You and who else, Vegeta?

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:14.620
Your army is so petrified that they're blue in the face!

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:15.960
Hmm?

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:46.220
King, no!

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:02.460
It's a pity, really.

00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:08.820
Don't be so glum, guys. You haven't lost your king for good.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:11.920
Wherever he is, you're about to join him.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:33.710
I say we torch the whole barrel of monkeys. What do you say, Zarbon?

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:36.410
Is it necessary now that King Vegeta's out of the way?

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:40.660
Yes, because when one revolts, the others are sure to follow.

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:43.140
You know, monkey see, monkey do.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:51.480
Just look at all those lost sheep waiting for the good news from their king.

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:47.690
This is great show!

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:50.290
Look at that!

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:09.170
I asked you to enjoy them, Vegeta. The fireworks they were to die for.

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:15.070
How absurd! You were afraid of the Saiyans, so you destroyed their entire race along with their planet.

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:22.710
And yet, you left the strongest one alive! Smart move, you fool! This is one mistake you're going to pay dearly for!

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:29.430
Why, you insolent tree monkey, you're the one who's going to pay! I've had enough of this!

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:33.390
Chalk! That's all you are, is a bunch of chalk.

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:38.430
Allow me to show you something that not even your father saw in his lifetime.

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:39.860
What now?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:00.140
Thank you.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:44.410
Oh, man. I can't even go on. No reason to live anymore.

00:12:45.150 --> 00:12:47.920
Except to get even with those jerks.

00:12:58.470 --> 00:12:59.450
What the heck?

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:00.770
What is it?

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:25.350
What in the world are they scared of?

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:30.710
You

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:29.240
What do you think?

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.620
Nightmare City!

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:40.470
Well, this is it.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:42.360
I hope you're not disappointed.

00:15:57.920 --> 00:15:58.840
Something's not right!

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:07.110
Holy smoke! All of a sudden, it feels like there are ten freezes! Hang on, Gohan!

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:21.950
My, my, what's the matter with you little insects? You seem frightened. Vegeta, you're speechless.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:29.980
Don't tell me that you've run out of bold threats already. Such paltry playthings, not worth transforming for, but I guess...

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.640
Some amusement is better than none.

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:42.740
Gah!

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:47.220
Whaa!

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:48.840
Yeah!

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:50.070
Auto-wind!

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:51.470
You like that, huh?

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:52.830
Why, thank you.

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:55.140
Most opponents never see it coming.

00:16:55.720 --> 00:16:57.240
I'm somewhat impressed.

00:16:58.050 --> 00:16:59.970
By the way, Vegeta, did I-

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:04.060
I happen to mention that my fighting power in this forum is over a million!

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:06.820
What?! No way!

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.540
One million?!

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:13.100
Don't believe it! That's impossible, even for him!

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:20.110
So, some non-believer will allow me to demonstrate.

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:06.920
What's going on?

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:10.270
No way, Frieza!

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:13.030
How can he have so much power?

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:13.850
How?

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:46.210
and where are you going huh you're ah i'm fine it's just a scratch no prob

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:53.890
now what's wrong please i can't take the long faces

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:59.870
here it's a beautiful day to die don't you agree with

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:03.400
I mean really, what else could you ask for?

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:09.240
The sun is shining, the sea is a sparkly blue, the mountains can be seen in the background.

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:11.400
It's positively perfect!

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:18.670
Now all we have to do is decide which one of you gets to die first!

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:32.970
Now let's see.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:55.240
This one.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:29.920
Do you really think you can save him, sir?

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.080
Sorry, it's too late.

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:41.380
Might I suggest you start worrying about yourself, huh?

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:45.340
Now who's going to be next?

00:21:46.260 --> 00:21:47.880
Let's see, will it be you?

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:51.470
Or how about you?

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:55.360
Or how about me?

00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:58.970
It makes no difference to me.

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:02.040
Yeah.

00:22:35.690 --> 00:22:36.070
Oh!

00:23:01.010 --> 00:23:03.360
And what about Krillin?

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:08.140
Don't miss the next exciting episode of Dragon Ball Z!
